---
title: Santee Catering | Sandwich Trays, Buffets & Office Catering
description: Order Pepper Farm Deli catering in Santee for office meetings, parties, and events. Explore trays, buffets, and group meal options.
layout: "base.njk"
---

{#
  DEV NOTE: We intentionally do NOT generate individual catering category or product pages.
  catering-categories.njk and catering-products.njk are kept for reference but excluded
  via /.eleventyignore (no output files). Catering links go to Toast online ordering instead.
  To re-enable, remove them from .eleventyignore.
#}

<div class="container max-w-screen-xl mx-auto mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-center deli-grad-text uppercase">Catering Menu</h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-center justify-center items-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">We Offer <span class="text-red-500">Lunch</span> and <span class="text-red-500">Dinner!</span></h2>
        <a  href="https://order.toasttab.com/online/pepper-farm-deli-235-town-center-parkway-suite-h" target="_blank" class="mb-8 solid-button w-[300px] !bg-red-600 hover:!bg-red-800 shadow-lg">Click Here to see pricing!</a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-0 mb-16 mx-auto">
        {# Breakfast categories are intentionally hidden from the catering page #}
        {% for category in catering.items %}
        {% set catName = category.fields.name | lower %}
        {% if not catName.startsWith("brk") and "breakfast" not in catName %}
            <a href="https://order.toasttab.com/online/pepper-farm-deli-235-town-center-parkway-suite-h" target="_blank" class="w-full max-w-[269px]">
                <img eleventy:widths="400" class="w-full mb-2 rounded-lg" src="{{ category.fields.icon.fields.file.url | cfimg("fit=thumb&w=400&h=300") | safe }}" alt="{{ category.fields.name }}"/>
                <h3 class="text-center font-bold text-xl text-lime-800">{{ category.fields.name }}</h3>
            </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

</div>
  <section class="section mb-16 px-4" aria-labelledby="confirm-catering-heading">
    <h2 id="confirm-catering-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">What to confirm before ordering</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Tell us your date, meal time, headcount, budget, and dietary needs. Minimum quantities and lead times depend on the selection and kitchen capacity. Confirm pickup at 235 Town Center Parkway, Suite H, Santee, or ask whether delivery is available for your address and what fees apply.</p>
    <p class="mb-6">The team will confirm your selections, total, and timing before your order is finalized. For today's availability, <a class="text-lime-800 underline" href="/same-day-catering/">see our same-day catering guidance</a>.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-6"><a class="solid-button" href="/catering-inquiry/">Request catering</a><a class="border-button" href="tel:+16192018129">Call 619-201-8129</a></div>
    <p>Planning resources: <a class="text-lime-800 underline" href="/blog/planning-an-office-lunch-in-santee/">office lunches</a> and <a class="text-lime-800 underline" href="/blog/planning-party-catering-in-santee/">party catering</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="container max-w-screen-xl mx-auto mb-16 px-4" aria-labelledby="catering-faq-heading">
    <h2 id="catering-faq-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">Catering FAQs</h2>
    <div class="bg-zinc-100 rounded-md p-4">
      {% from 'macros/faq/faq-section.njk' import faqSection %}
      {{ faqSection(phase2Faqs.catering) }}
    </div>
  </section>
